{"id":"d5061ee58e7236de","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-dualenergywitness.md","title":"A small energy certificate for failure of duality","display":"thm-dualenergywitness — A small energy certificate for failure of duality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-dualenergywitness","aliases":["27-thm-dualenergywitness"],"display":"thm-dualenergywitness — A small energy certificate for failure of duality","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§4.4.2 Theorem 4.35","source_printed_pages":"193","source_pdf_pages":"217","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-dualenergywitness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-dualenergywitness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dualenergywitness — A small energy certificate for failure of duality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.4.2 Theorem 4.35"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"193"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"217"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f,g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 与补向量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(\\bar a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>）由下式构造。空积等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{i\\in I}a_i\\mid I\\in\\mathcal F\\right\\}\\right),\\qquad g(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{j\\in J}a_j\\mid J\\in\\mathcal G\\right\\}\\right),\\qquad\\bar a\\coloneqq(1-a_i)_{i\\in N}\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{i\\in I}a_i\\mid I\\in\\mathcal F\\right\\}\\right),\\qquad g(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{j\\in J}a_j\\mid J\\in\\mathcal G\\right\\}\\right),\\qquad\\bar a\\coloneqq(1-a_i)_{i\\in N}\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\coloneqq\\sum_{I\\in\\mathcal F}2^{-|I|}+\\sum_{J\\in\\mathcal G}2^{-|J|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\coloneqq\\sum_{I\\in\\mathcal F}2^{-|I|}+\\sum_{J\\in\\mathcal G}2^{-|J|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{I\\in\\mathcal F}\\prod_{i\\in I}x_i+\\sum_{J\\in\\mathcal G}\\prod_{j\\in J}(1-x_j)\\qquad(x\\in[0,1]^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{I\\in\\mathcal F}\\prod_{i\\in I}x_i+\\sum_{J\\in\\mathcal G}\\prod_{j\\in J}(1-x_j)\\qquad(x\\in[0,1]^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)&lt;1\\Rightarrow\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\left(Q(a)=0\\land f(a)=0\\land g(\\bar a)=0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)&lt;1\\Rightarrow\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\left(Q(a)=0\\land f(a)=0\\land g(\\bar a)=0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Q 在中心点的值是 E，且每个坐标分别仿射。逐坐标选不增加 Q 的端点后得到二值 a；此时 Q(a) 为非负整数且小于 1，必为零。所有项均零，于是 f(a)=g(补 a)=0，违背互为对偶的条件。这里保留输入取补，避免 PDF 文本漏横线造成错误的同点比较。已核对原书多项式与端点化证明；该证书不要求交叉相交，也不要求输入项族已经极小。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{i\\in I}a_i\\mid I\\in\\mathcal F\\right\\}\\right),\\qquad g(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\prod_{j\\in J}a_j\\mid J\\in\\mathcal G\\right\\}\\right),\\qquad\\bar a\\coloneqq(1-a_i)_{i\\in N}\\quad(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\coloneqq\\sum_{I\\in\\mathcal F}2^{-|I|}+\\sum_{J\\in\\mathcal G}2^{-|J|}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{I\\in\\mathcal F}\\prod_{i\\in I}x_i+\\sum_{J\\in\\mathcal G}\\prod_{j\\in J}(1-x_j)\\qquad(x\\in[0,1]^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)<1\\Rightarrow\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\left(Q(a)=0\\land f(a)=0\\land g(\\bar a)=0\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2183,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-dualenergywitness|thm-dualenergywitness — A small energy certificate for failure of duality]]"},{"id":"c8e6e68ee99c4e42","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$N=[n]$，$\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)$ 非空，$I\\cap J\\ne\\varnothing$ 对全部 $I\\in\\mathcal F,J\\in\\mathcal G$ 成立。$\\mathcal E$ 见 [[27-thm-dualenergywitness]]，且 $\\mathcal E(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\ge1$。$M=|\\mathcal F|+|\\mathcal G|\\ge2$。"}],"outgoing":[]}